### Summary of Changes

1. **Path Validation Module**
   - Created [packages/core/src/utils/path-validator.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/large_golden_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_25972/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/core/src/utils/path-validator.ts) containing `validatePath` to preemptively validate filesystem paths for newlines/control characters (`/[\n\r\0\t]/`), log markers (`AssertionError`, `FAIL `, etc.), suspicious quotes/ellipses (`"`, `` ` ``, `...`, `…`), and length limits (4096 absolute length and 255 length per path component). Valid paths containing spaces, apostrophes, and brackets are still accepted.

2. **At-Command Resolution Utilities**
   - Created [packages/core/src/utils/atCommandUtils.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/large_golden_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_25972/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/core/src/utils/atCommandUtils.ts) implementing `tryExtractPath` and `resolveAtCommandPath`. If a raw string contains a log snippet or terminal paste, it isolates any valid nested path (e.g. within parentheses or trailing line/column markers), and rejects malformed log blocks that don't contain a valid filename.

3. **Core Registry Export**
   - Updated [packages/core/src/index.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/large_golden_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_25972/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/core/src/index.ts) to export both `validatePath` and `resolveAtCommandPath` so they are accessible by consumer packages.

4. **Config Path Authorization Safe Check**
   - Integrated `validatePath` into `Config.validatePathAccess` inside [packages/core/src/config/config.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/large_golden_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_25972/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/core/src/config/config.ts) to intercept and validate input paths before invoking system APIs.

5. **CLI CLI Hook & Command Handling**
   - Refactored `checkPermissions` and `resolveFilePaths` in [packages/cli/src/ui/hooks/atCommandProcessor.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/large_golden_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_25972/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/cli/src/ui/hooks/atCommandProcessor.ts) and `atPath` command handling in [packages/cli/src/acp/acpSession.ts](file:///usr/local/google/home/joneba/ssr-prototype/gcli-intern-project/tools/caretaker-agent/evals/pr-generation/run_outputs/large_golden_3.5_flash/agent_environments/gemini_cli_25972/tmp/pr/gemini-cli/packages/cli/src/acp/acpSession.ts) to parse raw @-command strings safely via `resolveAtCommandPath`.

